<aetgt:getResponse xmlns:aetgt="http://schemas.active-endpoints.com/appmodules/repository/2010/10/avrepository.xsd"
                   xmlns:types1="http://schemas.active-endpoints.com/appmodules/repository/2010/10/avrepository.xsd">
   <types1:Item>
      <types1:EntryId>VYIrQ7qaaXeojtBdb9dXHt-gt-00000011-2026-07-27T17:44:00.000Z::pd.xml</types1:EntryId>
      <types1:Name>ProcessOneEmployee_Process</types1:Name>
      <types1:MimeType>application/xml+process</types1:MimeType>
      <types1:Description>Per-employee body: detail + search + create-or-update + phone reconciliation. Invoked once per changed XRefCode by the Orchestrator via a runForEach subflow call.</types1:Description>
      <types1:AppliesTo/>
      <types1:Tags/>
      <types1:VersionLabel>1.0</types1:VersionLabel>
      <types1:State>CURRENT</types1:State>
      <types1:ProcessGroup/>
      <types1:CreatedBy>abdul.mannuru@hubbard.com.dev</types1:CreatedBy>
      <types1:CreationDate>2026-07-27T17:44:00Z</types1:CreationDate>
      <types1:ModifiedBy/>
      <types1:PublicationStatus>unpublished</types1:PublicationStatus>
      <types1:Entry>
         <process xmlns="http://schemas.active-endpoints.com/appmodules/screenflow/2010/10/avosScreenflow.xsd"
                  xmlns:tfm="http://schemas.active-endpoints.com/appmodules/screenflow/2021/04/taskflowModel.xsd"
                  xmlns:list="urn:activevos:spi:list:functions"
                  GUID="VYIrQ7qaaXeojtBdb9dXHt"
                  displayName="ProcessOneEmployee_Process"
                  name="ProcessOneEmployee_Process"
                  overrideAPIName="false">
            <parameterSet xmlns="http://schemas.active-endpoints.com/appmodules/screenflow/2021/04/taskflowModel.xsd"/>
            <appliesTo/>
            <description>Everything the design's functional scenarios 1-4 require for a single Dayforce employee: GetEmployeeDetail_Process, SearchPerson_Process, the Create/Update Decision (build guide 4.7), the matching Create or Update+Writeback path, and phone reconciliation (build guide 4.11-4.12). This process itself is called once per changed XRefCode by the Orchestrator using a runForEach subflow call (build guide 4.15).</description>
            <tags/>
            <generator>Informatica Process Designer 11</generator>
            <input>
               <parameter description="Dayforce employee XRefCode being processed this iteration" name="in_XRefCode" required="true" type="string">
                  <options><option name="required">false</option></options>
               </parameter>
               <parameter description="Dayforce bearer token (run-scoped, from the Orchestrator)" name="in_access_token" required="true" type="string">
                  <options><option name="required">false</option></options>
               </parameter>
               <parameter description="CPD bearer token (run-scoped, from the Orchestrator)" name="in_cpd_token" required="true" type="string">
                  <options><option name="required">false</option></options>
               </parameter>
            </input>
            <tempFields>
               <field description="" name="tmp_Employee" type="xml"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_ActiveWorkContract" type="xml"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_Contacts" type="xml"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_PersonFound" type="boolean"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_personVinciId" type="string"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_ExistingContractId" type="string"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_ExistingPhones" type="xml"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_NewPersonVinciId" type="string"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_NewContractId" type="string"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_ActivePersonVinciId" type="string"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_ActiveContractId" type="string"><options><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_DayforcePhones" type="string"><options><option name="multiSelect">true</option><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_PhonesToAdd" type="string"><options><option name="multiSelect">true</option><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_PhonesToUpdate" type="string"><options><option name="multiSelect">true</option><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
               <field description="" name="tmp_PhonesToDelete" type="string"><options><option name="multiSelect">true</option><option name="required">false</option></options></field>
            </tempFields>
            <notes>Hand-authored against the CPD-Dayforce Functional Design &amp; API Build Guide v1.0 and verified against real IICS Process Designer 11 exports - see README_IICS_BUILD_NOTES.md for the full open-items list and schema caveats.

FAULT HANDLING REMOVED (build guide 4.13, not yet re-added): this process originally wrapped the whole body below in an &lt;eventContainer&gt; with a &lt;catch&gt; routing to ErrorAlert_Process on any fault. On import, that step rendered as a blank/un-typed "name:" placeholder stuck in "Validation in progress" - the same symptom seen earlier in this build whenever an element name isn't recognized. Every real IICS export found during this build only ever showed &lt;eventContainer&gt; watching a single activity (one subflow or service call), never a whole multi-step sequence like this one - so that was always flagged as the lowest-confidence part of this file, and it turned out to be wrong. Removed entirely rather than guess a third time; add fault handling back manually in Process Designer once this imports cleanly (most designers expose a per-step or wrap-in-scope "Add Exception/Fault Handler" action in the palette/right-click menu - use that instead of hand-authored XML for this piece). ErrorAlert_Process (which formats the alert message) is unaffected and still importable/callable on its own; it's just not wired into this process's error path yet.

LOWEST-CONFIDENCE PART OF THIS FILE NOW: the three phone reconciliation steps (sf-addphones/sf-updatephones/sf-deletephones) use &lt;subflow runForEach="true"&gt; to call AddPhoneNumber_Process/UpdatePhoneNumber_Process/DeletePhoneNumber_Process once per entry in tmp_PhonesToAdd/Update/Delete. Every real IICS export found while researching this schema had runForEach=false; no populated runForEach=true example was available to confirm exactly how per-item field binding works when it's true. Re-check this in Process Designer's own "Repeat"/loop configuration UI after import and correct the binding if needed - the intent (call the phone sub-process once per list entry) is documented here even if the exact XML wiring needs adjustment.

Phone comparison (dp-comparephones): tmp_Contacts field names (ContactType/ContactDetail) and the Dayforce-contact-type-to-CPD-phoneTypeCode mapping are placeholders - no sample of the expanded Contacts.Items shape was available (see design doc Open Item on phone type code mapping, section 3.2.5).</notes>
            <deployment skipIfRunning="false" suspendOnFault="false" tracingLevel="none">
               <rest/>
            </deployment>
            <flow id="a">
               <start id="b">
                  <link id="l1" targetId="sf-getdetail"/>
               </start>
               <subflow id="sf-getdetail">
                  <title>Get employee detail</title>
                  <subflowGUID>aDhurm6YPSRfpX6jx48p6H</subflowGUID>
                  <subflowPath>GetEmployeeDetail_Process</subflowPath>
                  <runForEach>false</runForEach>
                  <input>
                     <parameter name="in_XRefCode" source="field" updatable="true">input.in_XRefCode</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_access_token" source="field" updatable="true">input.in_access_token</parameter>
                  </input>
                  <outputDef/>
                  <link id="l2" targetId="asn-savedetail"/>
               </subflow>
               <assignment id="asn-savedetail">
                  <title>Save employee detail</title>
                  <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_Employee">output.out_Employee</operation>
                  <operation source="formula" to="temp.tmp_ActiveWorkContract">
                     <expression language="XQuery">($output.out_WorkContracts/*[isActive/text() = 'true'])[1]</expression>
                  </operation>
                  <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_Contacts">output.out_Contacts</operation>
                  <link id="l3" targetId="sf-search"/>
               </assignment>
               <subflow id="sf-search">
                  <title>Search CPD for existing person</title>
                  <subflowGUID>7n7iMGoFQB6dEzRA4TyXyr</subflowGUID>
                  <subflowPath>SearchPerson_Process</subflowPath>
                  <runForEach>false</runForEach>
                  <input>
                     <parameter name="in_EmployeeNumber" source="field" updatable="true">output.out_EmployeeNumber</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_cpd_token" source="field" updatable="true">input.in_cpd_token</parameter>
                  </input>
                  <outputDef/>
                  <link id="l4" targetId="asn-savesearch"/>
               </subflow>
               <assignment id="asn-savesearch">
                  <title>Save search result</title>
                  <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_PersonFound">output.out_PersonFound</operation>
                  <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_personVinciId">output.out_personVinciId</operation>
                  <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_ExistingContractId">output.out_ExistingContractId</operation>
                  <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_ExistingPhones">output.out_ExistingPhones</operation>
                  <link id="l5" targetId="dec-createOrUpdate"/>
               </assignment>
               <container id="dec-createOrUpdate" type="exclusive">
                  <title>Person found?</title>
                  <flow id="branch-update">
                     <subflow id="sf-update">
                        <title>Update person + contract</title>
                        <subflowGUID>cPu3ROm1I27g3XxioV28Yq</subflowGUID>
                        <subflowPath>UpdatePersonAndContract_Process</subflowPath>
                        <runForEach>false</runForEach>
                        <input>
                           <parameter name="in_personVinciId" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_personVinciId</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_ExistingContractId" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_ExistingContractId</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_FirstName" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/FirstName</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_LastName" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/LastName</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_PreferredFirstName" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/PreferredFirstName</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_PreferredLastName" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/PreferredLastName</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_BirthDate" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/BirthDate</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_CultureCode" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/Culture/XRefCode</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_HomeOrgLedgerCode" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/HomeOrganization/LedgerCode</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_ActiveWorkContract" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_ActiveWorkContract</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_cpd_token" source="field" updatable="true">input.in_cpd_token</parameter>
                        </input>
                        <outputDef/>
                        <link id="l6" targetId="asn-resolveupdate"/>
                     </subflow>
                     <assignment id="asn-resolveupdate">
                        <title>Resolve active ids (Update path)</title>
                        <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_ActivePersonVinciId">temp.tmp_personVinciId</operation>
                        <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_ActiveContractId">temp.tmp_ExistingContractId</operation>
                        <link id="l7" targetId="dec-createOrUpdate" type="containerLink"/>
                     </assignment>
                  </flow>
                  <flow id="branch-create">
                     <subflow id="sf-create">
                        <title>Create person + contract</title>
                        <subflowGUID>7fxMqJIQj2eigrAD3AjsqS</subflowGUID>
                        <subflowPath>CreatePersonAndContract_Process</subflowPath>
                        <runForEach>false</runForEach>
                        <input>
                           <parameter name="in_EmployeeNumber" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/EmployeeNumber</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_FirstName" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/FirstName</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_LastName" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/LastName</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_PreferredFirstName" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/PreferredFirstName</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_PreferredLastName" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/PreferredLastName</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_BirthDate" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/BirthDate</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_SeniorityDate" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/SeniorityDate</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_CultureCode" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/Culture/XRefCode</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_HomeOrgLedgerCode" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_Employee/HomeOrganization/LedgerCode</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_ActiveWorkContract" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_ActiveWorkContract</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_cpd_token" source="field" updatable="true">input.in_cpd_token</parameter>
                        </input>
                        <outputDef/>
                        <link id="l8" targetId="asn-savecreate"/>
                     </subflow>
                     <assignment id="asn-savecreate">
                        <title>Save new ids</title>
                        <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_NewPersonVinciId">output.out_NewPersonVinciId</operation>
                        <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_NewContractId">output.out_NewContractId</operation>
                        <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_ActivePersonVinciId">output.out_NewPersonVinciId</operation>
                        <operation source="field" to="temp.tmp_ActiveContractId">output.out_NewContractId</operation>
                        <link id="l9" targetId="sf-writeback"/>
                     </assignment>
                     <subflow id="sf-writeback">
                        <title>Write VINCI ID back to Dayforce</title>
                        <subflowGUID>a7jAK3mkjWNb0FDymjNpiw</subflowGUID>
                        <subflowPath>WriteVinciId_Process</subflowPath>
                        <runForEach>false</runForEach>
                        <input>
                           <parameter name="in_XRefCode" source="field" updatable="true">input.in_XRefCode</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_NewPersonVinciId" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_NewPersonVinciId</parameter>
                           <parameter name="in_access_token" source="field" updatable="true">input.in_access_token</parameter>
                        </input>
                        <outputDef/>
                        <link id="l10" targetId="dec-createOrUpdate" type="containerLink"/>
                     </subflow>
                  </flow>
                  <link id="l11" targetId="branch-update" type="containerLink">
                     <condition source="formula">
                        <function name="true">
                           <arg name="field">{$temp.tmp_PersonFound}</arg>
                        </function>
                     </condition>
                  </link>
                  <link id="l12" targetId="branch-create" type="containerLink">
                     <condition source="formula">
                        <function name="false">
                           <arg name="field">{$temp.tmp_PersonFound}</arg>
                        </function>
                     </condition>
                  </link>
                  <link id="l13" targetId="dp-comparephones"/>
               </container>
               <assignment id="dp-comparephones">
                  <title>Compare phone list (Dayforce vs. CPD)</title>
                  <operation source="formula" to="temp.tmp_DayforcePhones">
                     <expression language="XQuery">for $c in $temp.tmp_Contacts/* return
&lt;phone&gt;
   &lt;phoneTypeCode&gt;{$c/ContactType/XRefCode/text()}&lt;/phoneTypeCode&gt;
   &lt;diallingCode&gt;{$c/DiallingCode/text()}&lt;/diallingCode&gt;
   &lt;number&gt;{$c/ContactDetail/text()}&lt;/number&gt;
&lt;/phone&gt;</expression>
                  </operation>
                  <operation source="formula" to="temp.tmp_PhonesToAdd">
                     <expression language="XQuery">for $p in $temp.tmp_DayforcePhones
where empty($temp.tmp_ExistingPhones/*[phoneTypeCode/text() = $p/phoneTypeCode/text()])
return $p</expression>
                  </operation>
                  <operation source="formula" to="temp.tmp_PhonesToUpdate">
                     <expression language="XQuery">for $p in $temp.tmp_DayforcePhones
where exists($temp.tmp_ExistingPhones/*[phoneTypeCode/text() = $p/phoneTypeCode/text() and number/text() != $p/number/text()])
return $p</expression>
                  </operation>
                  <operation source="formula" to="temp.tmp_PhonesToDelete">
                     <expression language="XQuery">for $e in $temp.tmp_ExistingPhones/*
where empty($temp.tmp_DayforcePhones/*[phoneTypeCode/text() = $e/phoneTypeCode/text()])
return $e</expression>
                  </operation>
                  <link id="l14" targetId="sf-addphones"/>
               </assignment>
               <subflow id="sf-addphones">
                  <title>Add phones (once per PhonesToAdd entry)</title>
                  <subflowGUID>9WIET5Qv4lVl2j23ISZyoe</subflowGUID>
                  <subflowPath>AddPhoneNumber_Process</subflowPath>
                  <runForEach>true</runForEach>
                  <input>
                     <parameter name="in_personVinciId" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_ActivePersonVinciId</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_contractId" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_ActiveContractId</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_phoneTypeCode" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_PhonesToAdd/phoneTypeCode</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_diallingCode" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_PhonesToAdd/diallingCode</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_number" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_PhonesToAdd/number</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_cpd_token" source="field" updatable="true">input.in_cpd_token</parameter>
                  </input>
                  <outputDef/>
                  <link id="l15" targetId="sf-updatephones"/>
               </subflow>
               <subflow id="sf-updatephones">
                  <title>Update phones (once per PhonesToUpdate entry)</title>
                  <subflowGUID>0ncoBf8fJhphLIRIv0RXOS</subflowGUID>
                  <subflowPath>UpdatePhoneNumber_Process</subflowPath>
                  <runForEach>true</runForEach>
                  <input>
                     <parameter name="in_personVinciId" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_ActivePersonVinciId</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_contractId" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_ActiveContractId</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_phoneTypeCode" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_PhonesToUpdate/phoneTypeCode</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_diallingCode" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_PhonesToUpdate/diallingCode</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_number" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_PhonesToUpdate/number</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_cpd_token" source="field" updatable="true">input.in_cpd_token</parameter>
                  </input>
                  <outputDef/>
                  <link id="l16" targetId="sf-deletephones"/>
               </subflow>
               <subflow id="sf-deletephones">
                  <title>Delete phones (once per PhonesToDelete entry)</title>
                  <subflowGUID>jlM9u0QPKK9ltcTL4PIAGA</subflowGUID>
                  <subflowPath>DeletePhoneNumber_Process</subflowPath>
                  <runForEach>true</runForEach>
                  <input>
                     <parameter name="in_personVinciId" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_ActivePersonVinciId</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_contractId" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_ActiveContractId</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_phoneTypeCode" source="field" updatable="true">temp.tmp_PhonesToDelete/phoneTypeCode</parameter>
                     <parameter name="in_cpd_token" source="field" updatable="true">input.in_cpd_token</parameter>
                  </input>
                  <outputDef/>
                  <link id="l17" targetId="c"/>
               </subflow>
               <end id="c">
                  <title>End</title>
               </end>
            </flow>
         </process>
      </types1:Entry>
      <types1:GUID>VYIrQ7qaaXeojtBdb9dXHt</types1:GUID>
      <types1:DisplayName>ProcessOneEmployee_Process</types1:DisplayName>
   </types1:Item>
   <types1:CurrentServerDateTime>2026-07-27T17:46:15.000Z</types1:CurrentServerDateTime>
</aetgt:getResponse>
